[{"verse":1,"text":"Hebr. to generation and generation."},{"verse":3,"text":"2.Sam. 7. 11,&c."},{"verse":4,"text":"Heb. to generation and generation."},{"verse":10,"text":"Or, Egypt. , Heb. with the arme of thy strength."},{"verse":11,"text":"Gen.1.1. psal. 24.1. psal. 50.12."},{"verse":13,"text":"Heb. an arme with might."},{"verse":14,"text":"Or, establishment."},{"verse":15,"text":"Num.10.6"},{"verse":18,"text":"Or, our shield is of the LORD, and our king is of the holy One of Israel."},{"verse":20,"text":"1.Sam. 16 12."},{"verse":31,"text":"Heb. profane my statutes."},{"verse":33,"text":"Heb. I will not make voyd from him. , Heb. to lye."},{"verse":35,"text":"Heb. if I lie."},{"verse":36,"text":"Rom.7. 16. Luc.1. 33. Iohn.12 34."},{"verse":44,"text":"Heb. brightnesse."},{"verse":49,"text":"2.Sam.7. 15."}]